WEBVTT

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:01.720
and a little more full of hope,

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:06.680
think about the tremendous power of sleep.

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:10.096
And think about what a gift it would be

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:14.136
for our children to be able
to wake up naturally,

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:16.400
in harmony with their own biology.

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:18.656
Thank you,

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:19.880
and pleasant dreams.